      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبَّاشٌ</span></b>  <i>One who rifles,</i> or <i>ransacks, graves; who
takes forth the dead from them;</i> or <i>who uncovers
graves.</i> (Mgh, Msb.) See 1, in two places.

